# Tuning Out (windurst 91), completion parity: 897's finish is npcUtil.completeQuest step for step (the Cache-Nez,
# stopping when it cannot be given; fame 40 Windurst; the title), ending in the raw player:completeQuest, so a GM's
# Quest[2][91]Prog survives the completion (quest:cleanup, which a called Quest.Complete() runs, would clear it).
# Tuning In completed and this quest accepted at TuningOut_Progress 8 (GM), beside Leepe-Hoppe.
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=12.9,-9.7,-197.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.TuningIn completed
quest Windurst.TuningOut accepted
charvar TuningOut_Progress 8
login
charvar Quest[2][91]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # default 345
finish
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # progress 8: 897
finish                                  # the Cache-Nez; Friend of the Helmed; fame 40; completed; progress 0; Prog kept
